    "text": "LIVE\nUpdated 1 hour ago\nStocks to Watch: SpaceX, Micron Technology, Remy Cointreau\n↗️ SpaceX (SPCX): Shares of Elon Musk’s rocket company rose nearly 8%, putting the stock on track to extend the 19% gain recorded on its trading debut.\n↗️ Micron Technology (MU), Super Micro Computer (SMCI), Marvell Technology (MRVL): Shares of companies tied to the AI buildout were among the biggest winners early Monday as the interim deal between the U.S. and Iran sent investors piling back into stocks.\n↘️ Marathon Petroleum (MPC), ConocoPhillips (COP), Occidental Petroleum (OXY): Energy stocks fell as oil prices slid to their lowest levels since the earliest days of the war.",
